                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000953> ;
                                              rdfs:label "atomic force microscope" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A microscope which uses a sharp spike (known as a 'tip') mounted on the end of a cantilever to scan the surface of the specimen. An image of the surface is obtained by mechanically moving the probe in a raster scan of the specimen, line by line, and recording the force experienced by the tip as a function of position. A feedback loop is used to maintain a fixed relationship between the tip and surface during scanning.[CHMO]" ;
